cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the exact repository commit used and preserve the source-data citations recorded by each case study or generated report. A versioned citation will be added only after the next public release version is reconciled."
type: software
title: "Materials Data Analyzer"
authors:
  - name: "jhin0410-lgtm"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jhin0410-lgtm/materials-data-analyzer"
url: "https://github.com/jhin0410-lgtm/materials-data-analyzer"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A provenance-aware command-line research software platform for auditable
  materials, process, quality, reliability, battery, and smart-factory data
  workflows. The project separates software validation from scientific
  validation, records trust boundaries, and preserves negative or blocked
  scientific conclusions rather than treating successful execution as proof of
  causal, predictive, or engineering validity.
keywords:
  - materials science
  - manufacturing data
  - process characterization
  - reliability
  - battery data
  - provenance
  - scientific validation
